title: Example - Fountain auto character
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki;vocab=Fountain

An uppercase line preceded by a blank line and followed immediately by a non-blank line auto-detects as a Fountain character cue. Same-line parentheticals like `(O. S.)` or `(on the radio)` are kept.

STEEL
The man's a myth!

MOM (O. S.)
Luke! Come down for supper!

HANS (on the radio)
What was it you said?
